          "en":  "Leave"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "asset":  "Assets/Scenes/Act 2 Main.unity",
      "localId":  "385697366",
      "id":  "act2.hospital_reception",
      "entries":  [
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_0.text",
          "ru":  "Больница закрыта",
          "en":  "The hospital is closed."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_0.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_7.text",
          "ru":  "Да, это была последняя выдача на сегодня. Что вам нужно?",
          "en":  "Yes, that was the last handout today. What do you need?"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_7.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_9.text",
          "ru":  "Я же сказала, последняя выдача, дрова закончились. Всё, до сви...",
          "en":  "I told you, that was the last handout. We're out of firewood. Now, goodb..."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_9.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_11.text",
          "ru":  "Что еще, я же всё уже сказала.",
          "en":  "What else? I've already told you everything."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_11.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_13.text",
          "ru":  "Ну поздравляю, будут новые соседи, поютитесь немного...",
          "en":  "Well, congratulations. You'll have new neighbours. You'll just have to squeeze in..."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_13.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_15.text",
          "ru":  "Как жена, как ребенок? Такие не должны заселять.",
          "en":  "What wife? What child? They shouldn't be moving anyone in if you have a family."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_15.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_17.text",
          "ru":  "А, ну тогда понятно. Вы что от меня хотите? Чтобы я вашу жену и ребенка записала в дом? Так я не могу такого, вам к чиновникам надо.",
          "en":  "Ah, I see. What do you want from me? To register your wife and child at your house? I can't do that. You need to see the officials."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_17.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_19.text",
          "ru":  "Есть такие, чиновникам, мед персоналу выдают.",
          "en":  "There are documents like that. They're issued to officials and medical staff."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_19.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_21.text",
          "ru":  "Это которые мертвых возят? Нелегко, наверное...",
          "en":  "The ones who transport the dead? That must be hard..."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_21.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_23.text",
          "ru":  "Я бы хотела помочь, но бумаги такой выдать больше не могу. Последнюю отдала. А новые будут только на следующей неделе.",
          "en":  "I'd like to help, but I can't issue you one. I gave out the last one. We won't get any more until next week."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_23.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_25.text",
          "ru":  "Увы, ничем не могу помочь. Последнюю бумагу выдали санитару, что перед вами вышел. Он и дрова последние забрал.",
          "en":  "I'm afraid I can't help. The last document went to the orderly who left just before you arrived. He took the last of the firewood, too."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_25.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_27.text",
          "ru":  "Да прям только что, может вы даже его видели, когда подходили.",
          "en":  "Just now. You might even have seen him as you came up."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_27.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_29.text",
          "ru":  "Всё, мне некогда с вами разговаривать, надо обход делать.",
          "en":  "That's enough. I don't have time to talk. I have rounds to do."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_29.name",
          "ru":  "Больница",
          "en":  "Hospital"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_4.text",
          "ru":  "Но вы же только что выдали дрова",
          "en":  "But you just gave someone firewood."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_6.text",
          "ru":  "Выйти",
          "en":  "Leave"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_8.text",
          "ru":  "Дров бы...",
          "en":  "Some firewood..."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_10.text",
          "ru":  "Постойте",
          "en":  "Wait."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_12.text",
          "ru":  "Мой дом будут заселять",
          "en":  "They're going to move people into my house."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_14.text",
          "ru":  "Но мне нельзя, у меня жена, ребенок...",
          "en":  "But they can't. I have a wife and child..."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_16.text",
          "ru":  "Они... Их нет по бумагам в доме.",
          "en":  "They... They aren't registered as living there."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_18.text",
          "ru":  "Я слышал, что можно получить бумагу, чтобы дом не заселяли.",
          "en":  "I heard there's a document you can get to stop them moving people in."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_20.text",
          "ru":  "Я возчик из санитарного отряда.",
          "en":  "I'm a cart driver with the sanitary unit."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_22.text",
          "ru":  "Я бы хотел получить такую бумагу, чтобы дом не заселили.",
          "en":  "I'd like one of those documents, so they won't move anyone into my house."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_24.text",
          "ru":  "Но мне сказали заселение через 2 дня будет.",
          "en":  "But they told me they're moving people in two days from now."
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_26.text",
          "ru":  "Когда вышел?",
          "en":  "When did he leave?"
        },
        {
          "key":  "act2.hospital_reception.node_28.text",
          "ru":  "Далее",
          "en":  "Continue"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "asset":  "Assets/Scenes/Act 2 Main.unity",
